                 
            	<h3><u>Ya moosa-e-kazim</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><span class="userContent">Abu ar-reza<br> <br> (Yabna jaffar, abur-raza) x2 (Abur-raza) x2<br> <br> (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> <span class="text_exposed_show"><br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda<br> <br> (Ya musa-e-kazim) x4<br> <br> 1. Tere baba imam-e-sadiq hai<br> <br> Jiske dam se hai Jafferi saare<br> <br> Deen-o-mazhab, sabak ibaadat hai<br> <br> Ham ko saaye usi ke dar se mile<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br><br> 2. Hai qaramat-e-murtaza tujhme<br> <br> Saailo(n) ke bhi ye ata tujhme<br> <br> Rad jo hoti nahi kisi surat<br> <br> Saans leti hai wo dua tujhme<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> 3. Tum bhi hajat rawa-e-alam ho<br> <br> Haideriyyat ka azm-e-mauqam ho<br> <br> Tum dua-e-janab-e-zahra se<br> <br> Pursadar-e-janab-e-adam ho<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> 4. Bas junoon-o-jabal jilawatni<br> <br> Tere pyaaro(n) ke tujhse hai paayi<br> <br> Kitne dana the tere diwane<br> <br> Umr bhar teri nokri karli<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> <br> Almadad (maula raza) x3<br> 5. Tera beta imam-e-zamin hai<br> <br> Jiske qabze mei raat hai din hai<br> <br> Wo khurasaan ka hai shehzada<br> <br> Har shifa uske dar pe mumkin hai<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> 6. Teri dukhtar hai qum ki shehzaadi<br> <br> Uski chowkat pe de sada jo bhi<br> <br> Joliyaa(n) apni bhar ke laata hai<br> <br> Ghamse milti hai usko aazaadi<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> 7. Tere taboot ki wo tanhaayi<br> <br> Na tha beta ghareeb na bhaayi<br> <br> Chand mazboor aye ujrat par<br> <br> Lash raste se teri uthwaayi<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> 8. Hai najaf dushmano(n) ke narghe mei<br> <br> Karbala samara ke raste mei<br> <br> Bekafan momino(n) ke laashe hai<br> <br> Kufr dakhil huwa madine mei<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> 9. Maula tu bhi dar-e-hawaaij hai<br> <br> Tera sikka jahaa(n) waaij hai<br> <br> Ham to har imtihaa(n) se guzrenge<br> <br> Dene wala tuhi nataij hai<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> 10. Tu bhi Rehan istighasa kar<br> <br> Kehke ya Musa ya bin-e-jafar<br> <br> Nauha goyi karu qayamat tak<br> <br> Aur ghulaami karu dar-e-shah par<br> <br> Tu saathwa mushkil khusha, noor-e-janaab-e-sayyeda (Ya musa-e-kazim) x2<br> <br> (Yabn-e-jaffar abur-raza) x2 Abur-raza</span></span></p>
                